   {
    "text": "Mina loves soccer. She can **kick** the ball hard with her right foot. But her left foot? \"My left foot is too **weak**,\" Mina says with a sigh.",
    "ko": "미나는 축구를 정말 좋아해요. 오른발로는 공을 세게 찰 수 있어요. 하지만 왼발은요? \"내 왼발은 너무 약해.\" 미나가 한숨을 쉬며 말해요."
   },
   {
    "text": "Coach Kim smiles. \"Great players use both feet. **Practice** every day, and your left foot will get strong.\" So every day after school, Mina kicks the ball against the wall with her left foot. Ten kicks, twenty kicks, thirty kicks!",
